{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19162","headline":"和留守令狐相公答白宾客 · 刘禹锡","name":"和留守令狐相公答白宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麦陇和风吹树枝，商山逸客出关时。\n身无拘束起长晚，路足交亲行自迟。\n官拂象筵终日待，私将鸡黍几人期。\n君来不用飞书报，万户先从纸贵知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}